From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:14:28 +0000
Subject: feat(richtext): add generic InlineBoxSpanStyle API and compose
 lowering

Introduce InlineBoxSpanStyle (background, border, padding, margin, corner
radius) on Compose SpanStyle/link styles and in core. applyAnnotatedString
now lowers each inline-box range to one InlineBoxGroupSpan that keeps its
styled children, semantic text and placeholders, instead of copying the box
onto every flattened fragment. Span rect lookups accept "index child" paths
so placeholders inside a group still resolve. Renderers follow separately.

Fork-Patch: richtext-inline-box-api-compose
Origin: 73fc777a 7ed15b7d e845df56 3099998f dd54e166 61da1f63 cd96a7f9
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

